/target
/.venv
**/__pycache__/
*.pyd
/python/sharpearena/sharpearena_py*.so
.pytest_cache/
*.whl

# Cargo.lock is COMMITTED here, like the workspace's. This crate is excluded from the
# workspace, so it resolves its own graph, and that graph is what the published wheel is
# built from: ignoring it meant every wheel came from a fresh unreviewed resolution.
